{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40521","headline":"伤彩饰 · 苏拯","name":"伤彩饰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝见亦光彩，暮见亦光彩。\n一旦风雨飘，十分无一在。\n尔形才似削，尔貌不如昨。\n本爲是凡姿，谁教染丹雘。\n虚饰片时间，天意以爲恶。\n物假犹如此，人假争堪作。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}